WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:32.041
In the next few verses,

2
00:00:32.041 --> 00:00:34.916
Lord Krishna clarifies why

3
00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:37.125
very few jīvātmās

4
00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:39.833
can truly know Him.

5
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:42.958
He explains that from the beginning of creation,

6
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:44.083
all beings

7
00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.791
become enchanted by the influence of māyā

8
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:51.041
and get entangled in dualities
 like desire and aversion.

9
00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:53.750
And because of this very
 entanglement and delusion,

10
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.791
they cannot recognize Lord Krishna's true form.

11
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:07.958
'Icchā-dveṣa-samutthena
dvandva-mohena bhārata,'

12
00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:10.041
Lord Krishna begins this verse

13
00:01:10.041 --> 00:01:12.291
with these words,

14
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:15.416
whose meaning is, 'O Arjuna,

15
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:20.833
all beings become confused because of
 the dualities of desire and aversion,

16
00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:26.291
and these dualities arise from the
 delusion of attachment and repulsion.'

17
00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:28.791
From the beginning of creation, jīvātmās

18
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:30.833
remain entangled in the web

19
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.583
of worldly dualities.

20
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:34.500
Based on their past births'

21
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.416
karmas and saṁskāras,

22
00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:39.208
they're attracted toward those things

23
00:01:39.208 --> 00:01:42.333
that give pleasure to their senses,

24
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:46.166
and experience repulsion from those things

25
00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:49.083
that are obstacles in this pleasure.

26
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:52.250
Trapped between this attraction and repulsion,

27
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.958
duality arises in their mind.

28
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:58.166
And from this duality, delusion is born.

29
00:01:58.166 --> 00:02:01.500
Understand this with this example –

30
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.250
if someone likes appreciation very much,

31
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.541
then that same person will start disliking

32
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:11.083
every person who criticizes.

33
00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:13.916
The more attraction in one direction,

34
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.625
the more repulsion will be in the other direction.

35
00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:21.750
And humans unable to
 maintain balance get trapped.

36
00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:25.625
Keep swinging between happiness and sorrow.

37
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:29.041
Then Lord Krishna says in the next line,

38
00:02:29.041 --> 00:02:31.458
'Sarva-bhūtāni sammohaṁ

39
00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:34.541
sarge yānti parantapa,'

40
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:37.750
here 'parantapa' means Arjuna.

41
00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:41.458
Lord Krishna is saying, 'O Arjuna,

42
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:45.000
because of this very duality, from birth itself

43
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.875
jīvātmās get trapped in a kind of hypnosis

44
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:52.500
and remain incapable of
 understanding My real form.

45
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.500
Because of the continuous desire
 to get happiness

46
00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.500
and continuous efforts to escape sorrow,

47
00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.208
their entire life

48
00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:02.500
gets entangled in worldly hypnoses.

49
00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.791
And this delusion affects all beings.

50
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:08.750
Crossing it is extremely difficult.

51
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.083
Because, humans affected by duality's māyā

52
00:03:11.083 --> 00:03:12.750
become so attached to family,

53
00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.958
honor,

54
00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:17.375
and material pleasures

55
00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:21.375
that the desire for devotion
 within them weakens.

56
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:23.791
And if there's no devotion and surrender,

57
00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:27.833
then obtaining Lord Krishna's
 true form is also impossible.

58
00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:31.125
Through this verse, Lord Krishna shows

59
00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:33.125
that the key to understanding Him

60
00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:35.750
is hidden in being free from delusion.

61
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.416
And only extremely rare people

62
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:41.125
can obtain this key.

63
00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:50.583
Attraction and repulsion,

64
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:54.541
attachment and detachment –

65
00:03:54.541 --> 00:03:56.375
humans

66
00:03:56.375 --> 00:04:02.416
keep swinging between these two.

67
00:04:02.416 --> 00:04:03.791
And this makes

68
00:04:03.791 --> 00:04:08.583
their perspective hazy.

69
00:04:08.583 --> 00:04:11.666
They simply cannot see that truth

70
00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:13.791
which is before them.

71
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:15.625
For example,

72
00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.250
if someone is attracted only

73
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:23.666
toward urban glitter,

74
00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:27.041
then they also make the mistake
 of considering village 

75
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:30.208
and countryside as backward.

76
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.166
They start connecting intelligence

77
00:04:32.166 --> 00:04:35.583
also to these things.

78
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:37.583
They forget

79
00:04:37.583 --> 00:04:38.916
that intelligence doesn't come

80
00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:43.000
only from living in cities,
 obtaining higher education,

81
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:48.041
or speaking some particular language.

82
00:04:48.041 --> 00:04:49.583
Rather,

83
00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:54.375
intelligence comes from life's experiences.

84
00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:57.500
And this can be with everyone,

85
00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:01.375
whether that person is a city resident

86
00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:03.583
or village.

87
00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:07.000
This very attraction toward one thing

88
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.416
automatically becomes repulsion

89
00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:14.250
toward another thing, and both these

90
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.166
take humans away from truth.

91
00:05:18.166 --> 00:05:20.875
When you're extremely anxious

92
00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:23.125
to obtain some thing

93
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:27.416
or eager to stay away from some thing,

94
00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:30.000
then you hurry in making decisions.

95
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.625
From this, the possibility of your
 decisions being inappropriate

96
00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:38.000
increases, and the path becomes difficult.

97
00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.250
In such a case, you see any circumstance

98
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.708
or thing not in its real form

99
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:48.708
but only from your desires

100
00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:52.333
and aversion's vision.

101
00:05:52.333 --> 00:05:57.708
And if you cannot see the real form,

102
00:05:57.708 --> 00:06:00.083
then it's natural

103
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:03.500
that you'll make wrong decisions.

104
00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.083
Along with this,

105
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:10.416
this is also like inviting sorrow and restlessness.

106
00:06:10.416 --> 00:06:14.250
Because if you make your likes and dislikes

107
00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.500
extremely firm, then naturally

108
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.625
things measuring up to your standards

109
00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:25.166
will keep reducing,

110
00:06:25.166 --> 00:06:27.416
and in most circumstances

111
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.125
you'll only remain restless.

112
00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:34.916
But when you develop your wisdom

113
00:06:34.916 --> 00:06:37.791
through the teaching of Bhagavad Gita,

114
00:06:37.791 --> 00:06:41.875
then you start rising above these dualities.

115
00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:43.208
You learn to see things

116
00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:48.083
in their real form, and

117
00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:51.666
balance comes in your thinking.

118
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:54.083
Only then can you make

119
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:57.333
life's decisions with calm and clear mind.

120
00:06:57.333 --> 00:06:59.750
And this has positive effect

121
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:04.125
on every part of life.

122
00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:10.458
When a baby

123
00:07:10.458 --> 00:07:12.916
is born,

124
00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:17.375
they're like an empty page,

125
00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:22.083
before whom there are limitless possibilities.

126
00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:26.000
Now on this empty page

127
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.958
will life's sweet song be written,

128
00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:34.500
will a story of success and peace be made,

129
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:41.125
or will a tale of dissatisfaction
 and sorrow be inscribed –

130
00:07:41.125 --> 00:07:44.708
the environment around that child

131
00:07:44.708 --> 00:07:46.375
will determine this.

132
00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:50.250
Yes, this thing is definitely true –

133
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:54.000
when every soul assumes a body, takes birth,

134
00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:58.625
then there's also influence of
 past births' saṁskāras on it.

135
00:07:58.625 --> 00:08:01.791
But this influence is soft

136
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:05.166
and can be changed.

137
00:08:05.166 --> 00:08:09.125
Through right saṁskāras,
 education, and spirituality,

138
00:08:09.125 --> 00:08:12.875
giving these samskāras a positive direction

139
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:15.875
is completely possible.

140
00:08:15.875 --> 00:08:19.000
And this is parents'

141
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.916
biggest responsibility.

142
00:08:21.916 --> 00:08:24.208
From the time of birth,

143
00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:28.291
a new journey of children begins,

144
00:08:28.291 --> 00:08:33.291
in which every step is important.

145
00:08:33.291 --> 00:08:34.708
Every child

146
00:08:34.708 --> 00:08:38.458
is surrounded by webs of likes-dislikes,

147
00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:42.875
attraction and repulsion all around.

148
00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:47.541
If right guidance isn't given,

149
00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:50.166
then growing up, they too

150
00:08:50.166 --> 00:08:55.583
will get trapped in delusion-māyā's duality.

151
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:58.875
Every parent must understand

152
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:02.041
that the meaning of children's
 upbringing isn't only

153
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:04.958
giving them education, keeping them healthy,

154
00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:09.750
or making them successful
 in the material world.

155
00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.791
Yes! All this is necessary, but in

156
00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:19.416
upbringing, developing children's spirituality

157
00:09:19.416 --> 00:09:23.750
is equally important.

158
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.666
This very spirituality will
 give them the capability

159
00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:31.041
to see any circumstance's true form.

160
00:09:31.041 --> 00:09:37.791
Through this, they'll be able to make
 life's important decisions correctly.

161
00:09:37.791 --> 00:09:39.000
Along with this,

162
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.041
your guidance filled with love,
 knowledge, and faith

163
00:09:43.041 --> 00:09:50.041
will affect both their character and future.

164
00:09:50.041 --> 00:09:51.916
Children learn most

165
00:09:51.916 --> 00:09:54.750
from their parents,

166
00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.375
therefore it's necessary that you
 yourself also rise above

167
00:09:58.375 --> 00:10:01.541
desires and aversion's duality,

168
00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:05.500
yourself also learn to make
 decisions impartially,

169
00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:09.625
and then teach this to your children too.

170
00:10:09.625 --> 00:10:11.250
Its purpose isn't only

171
00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.666
making them successful

172
00:10:12.666 --> 00:10:15.250
in the material world,

173
00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.833
but strengthening their soul

174
00:10:17.833 --> 00:10:22.041
and personality.

175
00:10:22.041 --> 00:10:24.583
You yourself know

176
00:10:24.583 --> 00:10:28.583
that in life success-failure,

177
00:10:28.583 --> 00:10:31.916
happiness-sorrow will keep coming.

178
00:10:31.916 --> 00:10:36.625
But if their soul remains strong,

179
00:10:36.625 --> 00:10:39.750
then they'll be able to pass
 through difficult times

180
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:43.458
with great gentleness and peace.

181
00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:47.791
Bringing children into this
 world and raising them

182
00:10:47.791 --> 00:10:50.500
isn't something ordinary,

183
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.708
rather this is an extremely sacred journey.

184
00:10:55.708 --> 00:10:58.416
And for this sacred journey,

185
00:10:58.416 --> 00:11:03.375
along with your love, cooperation,
 and encouragement,

186
00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:09.791
you can also give them another big gift –

187
00:11:09.791 --> 00:11:12.000
this knowledge of Bhagavad Gita.

188
00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.583
Inspire them to come toward Me.

189
00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:19.291
If you're with them,

190
00:11:19.291 --> 00:11:21.583
this Bhagavad Gita is with them,

191
00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:25.750
and I Myself am with them,

192
00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.750
then the question of failure in life

193
00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.458
simply doesn't arise.

194
00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:38.666
'Icchā-dveṣa-samutthena

195
00:11:38.666 --> 00:11:42.791
dvandva-mohena bhārata' –

196
00:11:42.791 --> 00:11:45.291
meaning

197
00:11:45.291 --> 00:11:46.916
Arjuna,

198
00:11:46.916 --> 00:11:49.791
all beings become confused

199
00:11:49.791 --> 00:11:55.666
from the duality of desire and aversion.

200
00:11:55.666 --> 00:11:57.500
And such duality also arises

201
00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:01.916
in professional life.

202
00:12:01.916 --> 00:12:03.875
When someone steps

203
00:12:03.875 --> 00:12:06.833
into professional life,

204
00:12:06.833 --> 00:12:10.375
then there's much self-confidence in the mind,

205
00:12:10.375 --> 00:12:14.833
limitless energy inside, and big dreams,

206
00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:16.250
but

207
00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.000
then that same person often

208
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.750
gets confused by being trapped in limited

209
00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.791
definitions of success and failure.

210
00:12:25.791 --> 00:12:30.500
A duality awakens inside the mind.

211
00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.458
When someone in professional life

212
00:12:32.458 --> 00:12:34.041
makes a narrow definition

213
00:12:34.041 --> 00:12:37.583
of their success

214
00:12:37.583 --> 00:12:42.833
and starts hating the word failure itself,

215
00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:45.000
then often this very duality

216
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.750
leads to wrong decisions.

217
00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.750
For example,

218
00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.500
if some person considers

219
00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.541
only and only wealth as success's symbol,

220
00:12:56.541 --> 00:12:57.791
then they'll start

221
00:12:57.791 --> 00:13:02.250
ignoring human relationships.

222
00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:05.333
Whereas, many times only good human

223
00:13:05.333 --> 00:13:09.875
relationships become success's ladder.

224
00:13:09.875 --> 00:13:11.750
Imagine,

225
00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.541
if some such person whom

226
00:13:14.541 --> 00:13:18.708
you helped without any greed later

227
00:13:18.708 --> 00:13:22.083
praises your business before

228
00:13:22.083 --> 00:13:25.041
many people –

229
00:13:25.041 --> 00:13:26.666
then this very praise can become

230
00:13:26.666 --> 00:13:31.416
a strong ladder of your success.

231
00:13:31.416 --> 00:13:32.666
But the

232
00:13:32.666 --> 00:13:36.625
person who'll remain attracted
 only toward wealth

233
00:13:36.625 --> 00:13:38.708
and reject every circumstance

234
00:13:38.708 --> 00:13:41.666
without economic benefit

235
00:13:41.666 --> 00:13:44.583
will never be able to understand
 this perspective.

236
00:13:44.583 --> 00:13:48.958
The answer is never in excessive attraction

237
00:13:48.958 --> 00:13:52.500
or excessive aversion.

238
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:56.666
Life's answer is in balance.

239
00:13:56.666 --> 00:13:59.875
Where there's no duality, where humans can

240
00:13:59.875 --> 00:14:04.208
see every circumstance impartially.

241
00:14:04.208 --> 00:14:06.125
Along with this,

242
00:14:06.125 --> 00:14:11.333
one who makes a narrow
 perspective of their success

243
00:14:11.333 --> 00:14:14.708
will never be able to learn new lessons.

244
00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:17.250
Because where on one side

245
00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:21.208
success brings joy, on the other side

246
00:14:21.208 --> 00:14:27.000
failure also brings many priceless lessons.

247
00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:33.041
In professional life, coming of both
 is certain, and according to time,

248
00:14:33.041 --> 00:14:36.041
both have their own importance.

249
00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:41.416
Therefore, avoid both attachment and aversion.

250
00:14:41.416 --> 00:14:44.916
Whether this is toward some person

251
00:14:44.916 --> 00:14:48.291
or toward some circumstance.

252
00:14:48.291 --> 00:14:51.541
Rise above this duality,

253
00:14:51.541 --> 00:14:54.083
learn from experienced people,

254
00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:55.500
give priority to your

255
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.000
spiritual path.

256
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.250
Keep walking on the steps
 shown by Bhagavad Gita,

257
00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.791
this will bring positive
 change in both your thoughts

258
00:15:04.791 --> 00:15:08.958
and behavior.
